Description: Local Ubuntu activity capture, intelligence, and desktop overlay for Intent
 Captures consented desktop, Firefox, VS Code, and shell metadata locally and
 derives deterministic local intent trees from it. It provides the Role A and
 Role B loopback APIs, the Role C Electron overlay, bounded resume data,
 reviewed restore controls, notifications, and a tray helper.
